    <string name="onboarding_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="onboarding_subtitle">What this app does, and what it cannot do for you.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_section_what">What a VPN does</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_what">A VPN forwards your traffic through a server you choose and encrypts it between this device and that server. It does not make you anonymous, and the sites you visit still see your requests.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_section_limits">Privacy limits</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_limits">Whichever server you connect to can see the address you are connecting to and the volume of your traffic. This app makes no no-logs claim, because there is no operator here to make one. A VPN is not antivirus, and it does not hide you from the network owner entirely.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_section_cost">Cost boundaries</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_cost">There is no bundled server fleet, no free unlimited exit and no subscription in this app. You supply a WireGuard configuration or run your own gateway. Nothing is purchased or enrolled by continuing.</string>
